==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|от-|пуска́ть}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|отпуска́ть}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-отпускать.ogg}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|отпуска́ть|impf|pf=отпусти́ть}}

# to [[let go]], to [[let off]]
#: {{uxi|ru|[[не]] '''отпуска́ть''' [[ни]] [[на]] [[шаг]]|not let stray one step, not let stir a step from one's side}}
# to [[release]], to [[set free]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''отпуска́ть''' [[на]] [[воля|во́лю]]|to set at liberty, to liberate}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''отпуска́ть''' [[на]] [[порука|пору́ки]]|to take bail}}
# to [[dismiss]], to give leave
# to [[supply]], to [[serve]], to [[issue]], to [[give out]], to [[sell]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''отпуска́ть''' [[шутка|шу́тку]]|to crack a joke}}
#: {{uxi|ru|'''отпуска́ть''' [[комплимент|комплиме́нты]]|to make compliments, to pay compliments}}
# to [[allot]], to [[assign]], to [[allow]], to [[provide]]
# to [[slacken]], to [[relax]], to [[turn loose]], to [[loosen]]
# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} to [[remit]], to [[forgive]]
#: {{uxi|ru|'''отпуска́ть''' [[грех|грехи́]]|to give absolution}}
# ''(hair or beard)'' to [[grow]], to let grow
# ''(metal)'' to [[temper]], to [[draw]]
# ''(pain)'' to [[lessen]], to [[ease]]

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|impf|1a|отпуска́ть}}

